  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive) <strong>♦</strong> <strong>Required Slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><strong>Fits:</strong> All Heavy SMGs, Assault Rifles, and Machine Guns</p>\n<p><em>A favorite of defense-line machine gunners since the late 1800s.</em></p>\n<p>Only one Heavy Barrel may be installed. When making an Autofire Attack with the weapon, its user may choose to suffer a -2 penalty and expend twice the amount of ammunition on the Attack. When done and rolling for damage, they may roll a d10 instead of one of their d6 damage die. This d10 does not implode or explode, and is not used for determining the incurring of Critical Injuries. Incompatible with Telescopic Barrel.</p>\n<p><strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Weapons &gt; Attachment Catalog &gt; Barrels &amp; Muzzles).</em></p>"
